      }
    },
    "Free": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ubuntu"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gratuit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Free and open source": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ni ubuntu, kandi kode yayo irafunguye"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gratuit et open source"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Free, with source available": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ni ubuntu, kode y'inkomoko iraboneka"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gratuit, code source disponible"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Friends who scan your code see it\nbeside your number, so they know it's you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos amis qui scannent votre code la voient\nà côté de votre numéro, et savent que c'est vous."
          }
        },
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inshuti zisikana kode yawe ziyibona\niruhande rwa nimero yawe, zikamenya ko ari wowe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Got It": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compris"
          }
        },
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Byumvikanye"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Groceries": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ibiribwa"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Courses"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Health": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ubuzima"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Santé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hi, I'm Shima, and I made StarHash.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Muraho, nitwa Shima, kandi ni njye wakoze StarHash."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bonjour, je suis Shima, et j'ai créé StarHash."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long a payment waits first": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Igihe ubwishyu bubanza gutegereza"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Combien de temps un paiement attend d'abord"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I built it because I was tired of how hard USSD makes paying. Typing codes and digging through menus for the things you do every day felt wrong, so StarHash does them in a few taps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nayikoze kuko nari narambiwe ukuntu USSD igora kwishyura. Kwandika kode no gushakisha muri menu ku bintu ukora buri munsi byansaga nk'ibidakwiye, ni yo mpamvu StarHash ibikora mu gukanda gake."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je l'ai créé parce que j'en avais assez de voir l'USSD compliquer chaque paiement. Taper des codes et fouiller des menus pour ce qu'on fait tous les jours n'avait pas de sens, alors StarHash le fait en quelques touches."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I hope it makes paying a little easier. Enjoy it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nizeye ko izakorohereza kwishyura ho gato. Uyikoreshe neza."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'espère qu'il rendra vos paiements un peu plus simples. Bonne utilisation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I made it on my own, because USSD made paying harder than it should be.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nayikoze ku giti cyanjye, kuko USSD yatumaga kwishyura bigorana kurusha uko byari bikwiye."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je l'ai créé seul, parce que l'USSD rendait les paiements plus difficiles qu'ils ne devraient l'être."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If something is off, write to me first. I answer you myself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Niba hari ikitagenda neza, banza unyandikire. Ngusubiza ubwanjye."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si quelque chose ne va pas, écrivez-moi d'abord. Je vous réponds moi-même."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you turn on the lock, iOS checks your Face ID, Touch ID or passcode. StarHash never sees your face or fingerprint; it is only told whether the check passed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nushyiraho ifunga, iOS igenzura Face ID, Touch ID cyangwa kode y'ibanga yawe. StarHash ntijya ibona isura yawe cyangwa igikumwe cyawe; ibwirwa gusa niba igenzura ryagenze neza."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si vous activez le verrouillage, iOS vérifie votre Face ID, Touch ID ou code. StarHash ne voit jamais votre visage ni votre empreinte ; il sait seulement si la vérification a réussi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Import data": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Injiza amakuru"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Importer des données"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Imported": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Byinjijwe"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Importé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Settings you can stop StarHash saving transactions, using contacts, remembering recent recipients, Nearby, auto-verify and each of its notifications at any time. You can delete any transaction, or erase everything with Delete All Data. Deleting the app removes it all too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mu Igenamiterere, igihe icyo ari cyo cyose ushobora kubuza StarHash kubika ibikorwa, gukoresha abo muvugana no kwibuka abo wishyuye vuba, ndetse ukazimya Hafi aha, Kugenzura byikora na buri menyesha yayo. Ushobora gusiba igikorwa icyo ari cyo cyose, cyangwa ugasiba byose ukoresheje Siba amakuru yose. Gusiba porogaramu na byo bikuraho byose."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dans Réglages, vous pouvez à tout moment empêcher StarHash d'enregistrer les transactions, d'utiliser les contacts, de retenir les destinataires récents, À proximité, la vérification auto et chacune de ses notifications. Vous pouvez supprimer n'importe quelle transaction, ou tout effacer avec Supprimer toutes les données. Supprimer l'app efface aussi tout."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Shortcuts, check **StarHash SMS** was added under that name.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Muri Shortcuts, reba ko **StarHash SMS** yongeweho kuri iryo zina."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dans Raccourcis, vérifiez que **StarHash SMS** a été ajouté sous ce nom."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Shortcuts, tap **Add Shortcut**.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Muri Shortcuts, kanda **Add Shortcut**."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dans Raccourcis, touchez **Ajouter le raccourci**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It comes straight back here. Nothing is saved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bihita bigaruka hano. Nta kibikwa."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il revient directement ici. Rien n'est enregistré."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It goes in your own QR code, so friends\nscan it to pay you. It stays on your iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ijya muri kode yawe ya QR, kugira ngo inshuti zawe\nziyisikane zikwishyure. Iguma kuri iPhone yawe."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il figure dans votre propre code QR, pour que vos amis\nle scannent pour vous payer. Il reste sur votre iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is removed from Buy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ikurwa muri Gura."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il est retiré d'Acheter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is removed from StarHash only.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gisibwa muri StarHash gusa."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elle est retirée de StarHash seulement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's free, its source code is public, and it's private: no account, no tracking. Your payments stay on your iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il est gratuit, son code source est public, et il respecte votre vie privée : pas de compte, pas de pistage. Vos paiements restent sur votre iPhone."
          }
        },
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ni ubuntu, kode yayo iri ku mugaragaro, kandi ni ibanga: nta konti, nta gukurikiranwa. Ubwishyu bwawe buguma kuri iPhone yawe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep On": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bigumeho"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Laisser activé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep a history of what you pay and receive": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bika amateka y'ibyo wishyura n'ibyo wakira"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Garder l'historique de ce que vous payez et recevez"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the codes you dial often, like cash out and bundles, and dial each one in a tap.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bika kode ukunze gukanda, nko kubikuza n'interineti, maze uzikoreshe ukanze rimwe gusa."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gardez les codes que vous composez souvent, comme le retrait et les forfaits, et composez-les d'une touche."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the codes you dial often, like pending approvals, cash out and bundles, and dial them in a tap. Pin up to eight to the top.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bika kode ukanda kenshi, nk'ibyemezo bitegerejwe, kubikuza n'interineti, maze uzikande mu gukanda rimwe. Shyira hejuru izigera ku munani."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gardez les codes que vous composez souvent, comme les approbations en attente, le retrait et les forfaits, et composez-les d'une touche. Épinglez-en jusqu'à huit en haut."
          }
        }
      }
    },
