            "value": "Afficher en haut qui vous avez payé en dernier"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows it as a QR code": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Iyerekana nka kode ya QR"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'affiche en code QR"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows it as a tree": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Iyerekana nk'igiti"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'affiche en arbre"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows its details": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yerekana amakuru yayo"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Affiche ses détails"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Signed, Shima": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uwawe, Shima"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Signé, Shima"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Smart categories": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ibyiciro byikora"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Catégories intelligentes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "So if you love it, a rating on the App Store is all I ask. It helps someone else find an easier way to pay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Niba rero uyikunze, icyo nsaba gusa ni amanota kuri App Store. Bifasha undi muntu kubona uburyo bworoshye bwo kwishyura."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alors si vous l'aimez, une note sur l'App Store est tout ce que je demande. Elle aide quelqu'un d'autre à trouver une façon plus simple de payer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Someone who says they sent you money by mistake and asks for it back is the usual trick.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Umuntu uvuga ko yakoherereje amafaranga yibeshye, akagusaba kuyamusubiza, ni wo mutego ukunze gukoreshwa."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quelqu'un qui dit vous avoir envoyé de l'argent par erreur et le redemande, c'est l'arnaque habituelle."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sort payments into categories by their names": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shyira ubwishyu mu byiciro hakurikijwe amazina"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Classer les paiements par catégorie selon leur nom"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sort payments into categories with Apple Intelligence": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shyira ubwishyu mu byiciro ukoresheje Apple Intelligence"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Classer les paiements par catégorie avec Apple Intelligence"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sound": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ijwi"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Son"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Source code": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kode y'inkomoko"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Code source"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StarHash": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "StarHash SMS": {},
    "StarHash cannot read your SMS. If you set up auto-verify, your own Shortcuts automation passes messages containing RWF to StarHash, which reads them on your iPhone to confirm payments. Messages that are not MTN MoMo or Airtel Money transactions are ignored and not kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash ntishobora gusoma SMS zawe. Niba utunganyije Kugenzura byikora, automation yawe bwite ya Shortcuts yoherereza StarHash ubutumwa burimo RWF, nayo ikabusomera kuri iPhone yawe kugira ngo yemeze ubwishyu. Ubutumwa butari ubw'ibikorwa bya MTN MoMo cyangwa Airtel Money burirengagizwa kandi ntibubikwa."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash ne peut pas lire vos SMS. Si vous configurez la vérification auto, votre propre automatisation Raccourcis transmet à StarHash les messages contenant RWF, qu'il lit sur votre iPhone pour confirmer les paiements. Les messages qui ne sont pas des transactions MTN MoMo ou Airtel Money sont ignorés et non conservés."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StarHash couldn't read it. Try saving it to your iPhone first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash ntiyabashije kuyisoma. Gerageza kubanza kuyibika kuri iPhone yawe."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash n'a pas pu le lire. Essayez d'abord de l'enregistrer sur votre iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StarHash has no account and no tracking. Your payments stay on your iPhone. Only your profile photo, if you add one, and an anonymous count of who uses StarHash reach its server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash n'a ni compte ni pistage. Vos paiements restent sur votre iPhone. Seule votre photo de profil, si vous en ajoutez une, et un décompte anonyme des utilisateurs de StarHash arrivent sur son serveur."
          }
        },
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash nta konti igira, nta n'ubwo igukurikirana. Ubwishyu bwawe buguma kuri iPhone yawe. Ifoto y'umwirondoro wawe gusa, niba wayishyizeho, n'umubare utavuga amazina w'abakoresha StarHash ni byo bigera kuri seriveri yayo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StarHash is Locked": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash irafunze"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash est verrouillé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StarHash is a free app that helps you pay with MTN MoMo and Airtel Money in Rwanda: it fills in the USSD code your wallet uses and opens your iPhone's dialer. By using StarHash you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash ni porogaramu y'ubuntu igufasha kwishyura ukoresheje MTN MoMo na Airtel Money mu Rwanda: yuzuza kode ya USSD konti yawe ikoresha, igafungura aho uhamagarira kuri iPhone yawe. Ukoresheje StarHash, uba wemeye aya mabwiriza. Niba utayemera, turakwinginze ntuyikoreshe."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash est une app gratuite qui vous aide à payer avec MTN MoMo et Airtel Money au Rwanda : elle remplit le code USSD de votre portefeuille et ouvre le clavier de votre iPhone. En utilisant StarHash, vous acceptez ces conditions. Si vous ne les acceptez pas, ne l'utilisez pas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StarHash is an independent app. It is not made, endorsed or supported by MTN Group, MTN Rwanda, Airtel Africa or Airtel Rwanda. MTN, MoMo, Airtel and Airtel Money are their owners' trademarks, used only to name the services StarHash works with.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash ni porogaramu yigenga. Ntiyakozwe, ntiyemejwe kandi ntishyigikiwe na MTN Group, MTN Rwanda, Airtel Africa cyangwa Airtel Rwanda. MTN, MoMo, Airtel na Airtel Money ni ibirango by'ubucuruzi bya ba nyirabyo, bikoreshwa gusa mu kuvuga serivisi StarHash ikorana na zo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash est une app indépendante. Elle n'est ni créée, ni approuvée, ni soutenue par MTN Group, MTN Rwanda, Airtel Africa ou Airtel Rwanda. MTN, MoMo, Airtel et Airtel Money sont des marques de leurs propriétaires, citées seulement pour nommer les services avec lesquels StarHash fonctionne."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StarHash is free, and its code is open for anyone to read and improve.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash ni ubuntu, kandi kode yayo ifunguriye buri wese kuyisoma no kuyinoza."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash est gratuit, et son code est ouvert à tous pour le lire et l'améliorer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StarHash is free, with no account, subscription or advertising. Its source code is published under the PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0, which lets you use and change the code for any non-commercial purpose.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash ni ubuntu, nta konti, nta kwiyandikisha kwishyurwa, nta n'amatangazo. Kode y'inkomoko yayo yashyizwe ahagaragara hakurikijwe uruhushya rwa PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0, rukwemerera gukoresha no guhindura iyo kode ku mpamvu iyo ari yo yose itari iy'ubucuruzi."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash est gratuit, sans compte, abonnement ni publicité. Son code source est publié sous la licence PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0, qui vous permet d'utiliser et de modifier le code à toute fin non commerciale."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StarHash is free, with public source code, no ads, no account, and your payments never leave your iPhone. There is nothing to buy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash est gratuit, avec un code source public, sans publicité ni compte, et vos paiements ne quittent jamais votre iPhone. Il n'y a rien à acheter."
          }
        },
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash ni ubuntu, kode yayo iri ku mugaragaro, nta matangazo, nta konti, kandi ubwishyu bwawe ntibuva kuri iPhone yawe. Nta kintu cyo kugura."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StarHash is meant for people old enough to have a mobile money account, and is not directed at children.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash igenewe abantu bafite imyaka ihagije yo kugira konti ya mobile money, kandi ntigenewe abana."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash s'adresse aux personnes en âge d'avoir un compte mobile money, et pas aux enfants."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StarHash is provided as it is, without warranty of any kind. As far as the law allows, its developer is not liable for any loss from using it, including a payment sent to the wrong person or for the wrong amount, a failed or delayed payment, a record that is missing or wrong, or a notification that is late, missing or wrong.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash itangwa uko iri, nta ngwate y'ubwoko ubwo ari bwo bwose. Mu rugero amategeko yemera, uwayikoze ntaryozwa igihombo icyo ari cyo cyose giturutse ku kuyikoresha, harimo ubwishyu bwoherejwe ku muntu utari we cyangwa bw'amafaranga atari yo, ubwishyu bwanze cyangwa bwatinze, inyandiko ibura cyangwa itari yo, cyangwa imenyesha ritinze, ritaje cyangwa ritari ryo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash est fourni tel quel, sans aucune garantie. Dans la mesure permise par la loi, son développeur n'est responsable d'aucune perte liée à son utilisation, y compris un paiement envoyé à la mauvaise personne ou du mauvais montant, un paiement échoué ou retardé, un enregistrement manquant ou erroné, ou une notification en retard, manquante ou erronée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StarHash never holds, sends or receives money. Every payment is made by your mobile money provider, after you check its details on the provider's own prompt and enter your PIN there. Check the amount and who it goes to before you confirm. A payment you confirm is between you and your provider, under its own terms and fees.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash ntijya ibika, yohereza cyangwa yakira amafaranga. Buri bwishyu bukorwa n'ikigo cyawe cya mobile money, nyuma y'uko ugenzura amakuru yabwo ku idirishya ry'icyo kigo ubwacyo, ukinjiza PIN yawe aho. Genzura umubare w'amafaranga n'uwo agenewe mbere yo kwemeza. Ubwishyu wemeje ni hagati yawe n'ikigo cyawe, hakurikijwe amabwiriza n'ibiguzi byacyo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash ne détient, n'envoie ni ne reçoit jamais d'argent. Chaque paiement est fait par votre opérateur mobile money, après que vous en avez vérifié les détails dans sa propre fenêtre et y avez saisi votre PIN. Vérifiez le montant et le destinataire avant de confirmer. Un paiement que vous confirmez est entre vous et votre opérateur, selon ses propres conditions et frais."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StarHash version %@, build %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash verisiyo %@, build %@"
