            "value": "Amabwiriza y'ikoreshwa"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conditions d'utilisation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That is an %@ number; you pay with %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Iyo ni nimero ya %@; wishyura ukoresheje %@."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "C'est un numéro %@ ; vous payez avec %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That's not the right message.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ubwo si bwo butumwa bukwiye."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce n'est pas le bon message."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The USSD codes, fees and limits StarHash uses come from the providers' published information, and the providers may change them without notice. The Transactions page is a record kept for you, from what you dial and the messages you pass to StarHash; your provider's records are the ones that count. With auto-verify on, a payment that no message confirms within an hour is marked failed; if it did go through, mark it as confirmed. StarHash's reminders and summaries are worked out from that record, and iOS decides when they show: a reminder that is late or never comes says nothing about whether a payment went through.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kode za USSD, ibiguzi n'imipaka StarHash ikoresha bikomoka ku makuru ibigo bitanga serivisi byatangaje, kandi ibyo bigo bishobora kubihindura nta nteguza. Ibikorwa ni inyandiko ikubikiwe, ikomoka ku byo ukanda n'ubutumwa uha StarHash; inyandiko z'ikigo cyawe ni zo zifite agaciro. Iyo Kugenzura byikora bikora, ubwishyu butemejwe n'ubutumwa ubwo ari bwo bwose mu isaha imwe bushyirwa mu byanze; niba bwarakunze, bushyire mu byemejwe. Ibyibutsa n'incamake bya StarHash bikorwa hashingiwe kuri iyo nyandiko, kandi iOS ni yo ihitamo igihe bigaragara: kwibutswa gutinze cyangwa kutaje na rimwe ntikuvuga niba ubwishyu bwaragenze neza cyangwa butagenze neza."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les codes USSD, frais et limites qu'utilise StarHash viennent des informations publiées par les opérateurs, qui peuvent les modifier sans préavis. La page Transactions est un historique tenu pour vous, à partir de ce que vous composez et des messages que vous transmettez à StarHash ; ce sont les relevés de votre opérateur qui font foi. Avec la vérification auto activée, un paiement qu'aucun message ne confirme dans l'heure est marqué comme échoué ; s'il est bien passé, marquez-le comme confirmé. Les rappels et résumés de StarHash sont établis à partir de cet historique, et iOS décide quand ils s'affichent : un rappel en retard ou absent ne dit rien de la réussite d'un paiement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The codes you dial often, one tap each, up to eight pinned.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kode ukunze gukanda, buri imwe ukanda rimwe gusa, ugashyira hejuru zigera ku munani."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les codes que vous composez souvent, une touche chacun, jusqu'à huit épinglés."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The day it comes": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Umunsi incamake iza"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le jour de l'envoi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first release of StarHash: pay with MTN MoMo or Airtel Money without typing USSD codes, and keep every payment in one place.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verisiyo ya mbere ya StarHash: ishyura ukoresheje MTN MoMo cyangwa Airtel Money utanditse kode za USSD, kandi ubike ubwishyu bwose ahantu hamwe."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La première version de StarHash : payez avec MTN MoMo ou Airtel Money sans taper de codes USSD, et gardez chaque paiement au même endroit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The font and code StarHash is built with, and their terms": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La police et le code de StarHash, et leurs conditions"
          }
        },
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Imyandikire na kode StarHash yubakishijwe, n'amategeko yabyo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The money goes to the number you pick.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Amafaranga ajya kuri nimero uhisemo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'argent va au numéro que vous choisissez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The month just ended, on the 1st": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ukwezi gushize, ku itariki ya 1"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le mois écoulé, le 1er"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The shortcut works. A message through the automation proves the rest.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shortcut irakora. Ubutumwa bunyuze muri automation ni bwo buzemeza ibisigaye."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le raccourci fonctionne. Un message passant par l'automatisation prouvera le reste."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The terms for using StarHash": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Amabwiriza yo gukoresha StarHash"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les conditions d'utilisation de StarHash"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The terms for using StarHash, in plain words.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Amabwiriza yo gukoresha StarHash, mu magambo yoroshye."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les conditions d'utilisation de StarHash, en termes simples."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The text of the MoMo SMS. In an automation, pass Shortcut Input.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inyandiko ya SMS ya MoMo. Muri automation, ohereza Shortcut Input."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le texte du SMS MoMo. Dans une automatisation, passez l'entrée du raccourci."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The wallet said it failed": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Konti yavuze ko byanze"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le portefeuille a indiqué l'échec"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These terms may change as StarHash does. The current terms are always here, with the day they took effect, and using StarHash after a change means you accept them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aya mabwiriza ashobora guhinduka uko StarHash ihinduka. Amabwiriza agezweho ahora ari hano, hamwe n'itariki yatangiye gukurikizwa, kandi gukoresha StarHash nyuma y'impinduka bisobanura ko uyemera."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ces conditions peuvent évoluer avec StarHash. Les conditions en vigueur sont toujours ici, avec leur date d'effet, et utiliser StarHash après un changement signifie que vous les acceptez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This code holds no number or merchant code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Iyi kode ntirimo nimero cyangwa kode y'umucuruzi."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce code ne contient ni numéro ni code commerçant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file is from a newer StarHash. Update from the App Store, then import it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Iyi dosiye yavuye muri StarHash nshya kuruta iyi. Vugurura StarHash kuri App Store, hanyuma wongere uyinjize."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce fichier vient d'une version plus récente de StarHash. Mettez à jour depuis l'App Store, puis importez-le à nouveau."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This isn't a valid code. Use only numbers, * and #, starting with * or # and ending with #.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Iyi si kode yemewe. Koresha imibare, * na # gusa, utangire na * cyangwa # kandi urangize na #."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce code n'est pas valide. Utilisez seulement des chiffres, * et #, en commençant par * ou # et en finissant par #."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This may be a scam": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ibi bishobora kuba ubutekamutwe"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ceci est peut-être une arnaque"
          }
        }
      }
