          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactiver la vérification auto ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn On": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fungura"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn it off any time in **Settings**.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wabizimya igihe icyo ari cyo cyose muri **Igenamiterere**."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivez-le à tout moment dans **Réglages**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn it on and StarHash remembers where you paid a number or a code, and suggests it when you are back there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bifungure maze StarHash yibuke aho wishyuriye nimero cyangwa kode, maze iyikwereke nugaruka aho."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activez-le et StarHash retient où vous avez payé un numéro ou un code, et vous le propose quand vous y revenez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn it on in Settings and only your face, fingerprint or passcode opens StarHash.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bifungure muri Igenamiterere, maze isura yawe, igikumwe cyawe cyangwa kode y'ibanga byonyine ni byo bifungura StarHash."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activez-le dans Réglages et seuls votre visage, votre empreinte ou votre code ouvrent StarHash."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn off %@ for StarHash.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zimya %@ kuri StarHash."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivez %@ pour StarHash."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn off the torch": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zimya itoroshi"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Éteindre la lampe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on %@ for StarHash.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fungura %@ kuri StarHash."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activez %@ pour StarHash."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on **StarHash SMS**.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fungura **StarHash SMS**."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activez **StarHash SMS**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on the automation": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fungura automation"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activer l'automatisation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on the torch": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cana itoroshi"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allumer la lampe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn them on for StarHash in the Settings app": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fungura imenyesha za StarHash muri porogaramu ya Settings"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activez-les pour StarHash dans l'app Réglages"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deux"
          }
        },
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ebyiri"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two things reach it. Your profile photo, if you add one: it is kept under a random id that your QR code carries, so people who scan your code see it, and never with your name or number; only your iPhone holds the key that can change or delete it, and removing your photo deletes it. And once a day, a random id made when StarHash was installed, with its version, so the number of people using StarHash can be counted. Nothing else is sent: no number, no name, no payment, no location.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deux choses y arrivent. Votre photo de profil, si vous en ajoutez une : elle est gardée sous un identifiant aléatoire que porte votre code QR, pour que les personnes qui scannent votre code la voient, et jamais avec votre nom ou votre numéro ; seul votre iPhone détient la clé qui peut la modifier ou la supprimer, et retirer votre photo la supprime. Et une fois par jour, un identifiant aléatoire créé à l'installation de StarHash, avec sa version, pour compter le nombre de personnes qui utilisent StarHash. Rien d'autre n'est envoyé : ni numéro, ni nom, ni paiement, ni position."
          }
        },
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ibintu bibiri ni byo biyigeraho. Ifoto y'umwirondoro wawe, niba wayishyizeho: ibikwa ku kimenyetso cy'impfabusa kode yawe ya QR itwara, kugira ngo abasikana kode yawe bayibone, kandi ntibikwa hamwe n'izina cyangwa nimero yawe; iPhone yawe yonyine ni yo ifite urufunguzo rwo kuyihindura cyangwa kuyisiba, kandi gukuraho ifoto yawe birayisiba. N'inshuro imwe ku munsi, ikimenyetso cy'impfabusa cyakozwe igihe StarHash yashyirwagaho, hamwe n'ubwoko bwayo, kugira ngo umubare w'abakoresha StarHash ubarwe. Nta kindi cyoherezwa: nta nimero, nta zina, nta bwishyu, nta hantu uri."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type a merchant code or a number, or pick a contact. Saved numbers and codes come up by name, with their photo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Andika kode y'umucuruzi cyangwa nimero, cyangwa uhitemo uwo muvugana. Nimero na kode wabitse bigaragara mu mazina yabyo, hamwe n'ifoto yabyo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapez un code commerçant ou un numéro, ou choisissez un contact. Les numéros et codes enregistrés apparaissent par leur nom, avec leur photo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type an amount first": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Banza wandike umubare w'amafaranga"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapez d'abord un montant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type an amount, pick a contact or a merchant code, and StarHash dials your wallet's code for you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Andika amafaranga, hitamo uwo muvugana cyangwa kode y'umucuruzi, maze StarHash igukandire kode ya konti yawe."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapez un montant, choisissez un contact ou un code commerçant, et StarHash compose pour vous le code de votre portefeuille."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type an amount, pick who gets it,\nand StarHash dials the code for you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Andika amafaranga, hitamo uyahabwa,\nmaze StarHash igukandire kode."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapez un montant, choisissez qui le reçoit,\net StarHash compose le code pour vous."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type an amount, pick who gets it, and StarHash dials the code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Andika umubare w'amafaranga, hitamo uwo agenewe, maze StarHash ikande kode."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapez un montant, choisissez qui le reçoit, et StarHash compose le code."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type an amount, pick who gets it, and StarHash dials your wallet's code for you. Your PIN is only ever typed into your wallet's own prompt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Andika amafaranga, hitamo uwo uyoherereza, maze StarHash igukandire kode ya konti yawe. PIN yawe uyandika gusa aho konti yawe ubwayo iyigusaba."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapez un montant, choisissez qui le reçoit, et StarHash compose pour vous le code de votre portefeuille. Votre PIN ne se tape que dans la fenêtre de votre portefeuille."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type anything, we'll find it": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Andika icyo ushaka, turakibona"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapez n'importe quoi, on le trouvera"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlock StarHash to see your payments.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fungura StarHash urebe ubwishyu bwawe."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Déverrouillez StarHash pour voir vos paiements."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlock with %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
