            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À quoi servait un paiement à une entreprise"
          }
        },
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Icyo ubwishyu bwahawe ubucuruzi bwari bugenewe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What each version brought": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ibyo buri verisiyo yazanye"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce qu'a apporté chaque version"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you sent and received in the week": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ibyo wohereje n'ibyo wakiriye mu cyumweru"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce que vous avez envoyé et reçu dans la semaine"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's New": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ibishya"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nouveautés"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's New in StarHash": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ibishya muri StarHash"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nouveautés de StarHash"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's new, the note and the source code": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ibishya, ijambo ry'uwayikoze na kode y'inkomoko"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nouveautés, le mot et le code source"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a %@ message brings money in": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Iyo ubutumwa bwa %@ buvuga ko wakiriye amafaranga"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand un message %@ annonce de l'argent reçu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a %@ message confirms a payment": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Iyo ubutumwa bwa %@ bwemeje ubwishyu"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand un message %@ confirme un paiement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a payment you made is still pending": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Iyo ubwishyu wakoze bugitegerejwe"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand un paiement que vous avez fait est encore en attente"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When no %@ message confirms a payment within an hour": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Iyo nta butumwa bwa %@ bwemeje ubwishyu mu isaha imwe"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand aucun message %@ ne confirme un paiement dans l'heure"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the summaries come": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Igihe incamake ziza"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand arrivent les résumés"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where StarHash opens": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aho StarHash ifungukira"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Où s'ouvre StarHash"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which SIM do you keep?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quelle SIM gardez-vous ?"
          }
        },
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ni iyihe SIM ugumana?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which carrier do you pay with? StarHash\ndials its codes for you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wishyura ukoresheje uwuhe murongo? StarHash\nigukandira kode zawo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avec quel opérateur payez-vous ? StarHash\ncompose ses codes pour vous."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who sent the message. In an automation, pass Shortcut Input's Sender.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uwohereje ubutumwa. Muri automation, shyiramo Sender ya Shortcut Input."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qui a envoyé le message. Dans une automatisation, passez l'expéditeur de l'entrée du raccourci."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With two, money between them is not counted as spent": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avec deux, l'argent entre elles ne compte pas comme dépensé"
          }
        },
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ufite ebyiri, amafaranga ava ku imwe ajya ku yindi ntabarwa nk'ayakoreshejwe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With your permission, StarHash reads your contacts to show who you can pay and to put names and photos on your payments. They are read on your iPhone only and never copied off it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Iyo ubyemeye, StarHash isoma abo muvugana kugira ngo ikwereke abo ushobora kwishyura, no gushyira amazina n'amafoto ku bwishyu bwawe. Basomerwa kuri iPhone yawe gusa kandi ntibigera bakopororwa ngo bayivemo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avec votre permission, StarHash lit vos contacts pour montrer qui vous pouvez payer et mettre des noms et des photos sur vos paiements. Ils sont lus sur votre iPhone seulement et jamais copiés ailleurs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write to Shima": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Andikira Shima"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Écrire à Shima"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Y": {
      "comment": "The period control's letter for a year",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wowe"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You are responsible for your iPhone, its passcode and who can use it. StarHash's Face ID lock keeps your transactions private, but your wallet is protected by your PIN. Never share your PIN with anyone, including someone who says they are from StarHash or your provider.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ni wowe ushinzwe iPhone yawe, kode y'ibanga yayo n'abemerewe kuyikoresha. Uburyo bwa Face ID bwo gufunga StarHash butuma Ibikorwa biguma ari ibanga, ariko konti yawe irindwa na PIN yawe. Ntukigere uha PIN yawe undi muntu uwo ari we wese, harimo n'uvuga ko aturuka kuri StarHash cyangwa ku kigo gitanga serivisi yawe."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous êtes responsable de votre iPhone, de son code et de qui peut l'utiliser. Le verrouillage Face ID de StarHash garde vos transactions privées, mais c'est votre PIN qui protège votre portefeuille. Ne partagez jamais votre PIN avec personne, y compris quelqu'un qui dit venir de StarHash ou de votre opérateur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can pin up to %lld codes. Unpin one to make room.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ushobora gushyira hejuru kode zigera kuri %lld. Kura imwe hejuru kugira ngo ubone umwanya."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous pouvez épingler jusqu'à %lld codes. Désépinglez-en un pour faire de la place."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're all set": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Byose biteguye"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tout est prêt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You've been using StarHash for two weeks now. Thank you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Umaze ibyumweru bibiri ukoresha StarHash. Urakoze."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous utilisez StarHash depuis deux semaines. Merci."
          }
        }
      }
    },
