            "value": "Vos codes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your iPhone and your PIN": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone yawe na PIN yawe"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre iPhone et votre PIN"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your name": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Izina ryawe"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre nom"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your number": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nimero yawe"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre numéro"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your own accounts": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos propres comptes"
          }
        },
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Konti zawe bwite"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your photo": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ifoto yawe"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre photo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your QR code carries it and payments dial from it, so make it your iPhone's default voice line too": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre code QR porte son numéro et les paiements passent par elle : faites-en aussi la ligne vocale par défaut de votre iPhone"
          }
        },
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kode yawe ya QR itwara nimero yayo kandi ubwishyu buyinyuraho, bityo uyigire na Default Voice Line ya iPhone yawe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your transactions (who, how much, when, whether they are confirmed, and the fee, reference and balance when a message gives them), the categories you add, your recent recipients, Buy's codes and your settings. All of it is saved in StarHash's own storage on your iPhone, and none of it is sent anywhere.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ibikorwa byawe (uwo, angahe, ryari, niba byemejwe, n'ikiguzi, kode y'igikorwa n'amafaranga asigaye iyo ubutumwa bubitanze), ibyiciro wongeyeho, abo wishyuye vuba, kode za Gura n'igenamiterere ryawe. Ibyo byose bibikwa mu bubiko bwa StarHash ubwayo kuri iPhone yawe, kandi nta na kimwe cyoherezwa ahandi."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos transactions (qui, combien, quand, si elles sont confirmées, et les frais, la référence et le solde quand un message les donne), les catégories que vous ajoutez, vos destinataires récents, les codes d'Acheter et vos réglages. Tout est enregistré dans le stockage de StarHash sur votre iPhone, et rien n'est envoyé nulle part."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your transactions (with where each was paid, when Nearby is on) and settings are part of your iPhone's own backups, to iCloud or your computer, which you control.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ibikorwa byawe (hamwe n'aho buri kimwe cyishyuriwe, iyo Hafi aha ifunguye) n'igenamiterere ryawe biri muri kopi zibikwa na iPhone yawe ubwayo, kuri iCloud cyangwa kuri mudasobwa yawe, ugenzura ubwawe."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos transactions (avec l'endroit de chaque paiement, quand À proximité est activé) et vos réglages font partie des sauvegardes de votre iPhone, sur iCloud ou votre ordinateur, que vous contrôlez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your wallet's messages confirm each payment for you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ubutumwa bwa konti yawe bukwemereza buri bwishyu."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les messages de votre portefeuille confirment chaque paiement pour vous."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your wallet's messages confirm each payment, with its fee and balance. Thank you for using StarHash.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ubutumwa bwa konti yawe bwemeza buri bwishyu, hamwe n'ikiguzi cyabwo n'amafaranga asigaye. Urakoze gukoresha StarHash."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les messages de votre portefeuille confirment chaque paiement, avec ses frais et son solde. Merci d'utiliser StarHash."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your wallet, your payments": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Konti yawe, ubwishyu bwawe"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre portefeuille, vos paiements"
          }
        }
      }
    },
